ow-this-dont-you-need-a-jailbreak","line":27},{"title":"right to root access","target":"https://medhir.com/blog/right-to-root-access","line":41},{"title":"meme of Brittany Broski making a grossed out face at the statement “letting iPad Pro run Mac OS”, while making an intrigued face at the statement “letting iPhone SOC run MacOS”","target":"https://storage.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/medhir-com/o/blog%2Fassets%2F8479c22a-c578-4fef-9d69-f6082928aa8e%2F8f64fcbf-9747-4da6-a719-3698e55c7b89.jpg?generation=1773425438539078&alt=media","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"less intrusive phone","target":"https://dumbwireless.com/products/mudita-kompakts","line":51}],"metadata":{"title":"Your Phone is an Entire Computer","source":"https://medhir.com/blog/your-phone-is-an-entire-computer","author":null,"published":"2001-03-13","created":"2026-03-14","description":"The new MacBook Neo announcement raises old questions around what rights we have (and don't have) to install software on devices we own.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"arxive/RKYV/Clippings/Your Phone is an Entire Computer.md"},
